msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "以下仅描述此模型/场景特有的关键参数。`max-model-len`和`max-num-seqs`需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

msgid "**PP2 prefill node-specific configurations (p0/p1):**"
msgstr "**PP2预填充节点特有配置（p0/p1）：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank`: The prefill engine is split as PP2 over the two prefill nodes — the 78 layers are partitioned as `41/37`. `--node-rank` is `0` on prefill node 0 (p0) and `1` on prefill node 1 (p1).\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` / `--master-addr` / `--master-port 7060`: PP runs over two nodes with the `mp` executor (no Ray required). `--master-addr` is `$local_ip` on prefill node 0 (p0, PP master) and `$node_p0_ip` on prefill node 1 (p1).\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: Enables the fused `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators.\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`: Enables FlashComm optimization to reduce communication and computation overhead on prefill nodes.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager`: The prefill side runs in eager mode (the `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph capture is used on the decode side instead).\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`: Minimal MTP speculation during prefill (decode nodes use a higher count, see below).\n"
"- `fuse_muls_add` / `enable_dsa_cp` / `enable_sparse_sfa_c8` / `enable_sparse_li_c8` / `c8_enable_reshape_optim` (in `--additional-config`): Mul-Add fusion, DSA context parallelism for long-context prefill, the SFA/LI sparse attention optimizations and the reshape optimization of the C8 quantized model."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"41,37\"` / `--pipeline-parallel-size 2` / `--nnodes 2` / `--node-rank`：预填充引擎在两个预填充节点上以PP2方式拆分——78层被划分为`41/37`。`--node-rank`在预填充节点0（p0）上为`0`，在预填充节点1（p1）上为`1`。\n"
"- `--distributed-executor-backend mp` / `--master-addr` / `--master-port 7060`：PP通过`mp`执行器在两个节点上运行（无需Ray）。`--master-addr`在预填充节点0（p0，PP主节点）上为`$local_ip`，在预填充节点1（p1）上为`$node_p0_ip`。\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用融合的`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`算子。\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`：启用FlashComm优化以减少预填充节点上的通信和计算开销。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager`：预填充端以eager模式运行（解码端则使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`图捕获）。\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`：预填充期间使用最小MTP推测（解码节点使用更高的数量，见下文）。\n"
"- `fuse_muls_add` / `enable_dsa_cp` / `enable_sparse_sfa_c8` / `enable_sparse_li_c8` / `c8_enable_reshape_optim`（在`--additional-config`中）：Mul-Add融合、用于长上下文预填充的DSA上下文并行、SFA/LI稀疏注意力优化以及C8量化模型的reshape优化。"

msgid "**Decode node-specific configurations (d0/d1):**"
msgstr "**解码节点特有配置（d0/d1）：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-bandwidth-bound token generation.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — decode processes one target token plus the 5 speculated MTP tokens per sequence per step (`(5 + 1) × 32`).\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 5, ...}'`: Higher MTP speculation count on decode nodes to maximize decode throughput.\n"
"- `recompute_scheduler_enable=true` (in `--additional-config`): Enables the recomputation scheduler. When the decode node KV cache is insufficient, requests are sent back to the prefill node to recompute the KV cache.\n"
"- `--async-scheduling`: Async scheduling on the decode side."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在解码节点上启用MLAPO融合，用于内存带宽受限的token生成。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`：解码节点上的小批量token限制——解码每步处理每个序列的1个目标token加上5个推测的MTP token（`(5 + 1) × 32`）。\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 5, ...}'`：解码节点上使用更高的MTP推测数量以最大化解码吞吐量。\n"
"- `recompute_scheduler_enable=true`（在`--additional-config`中）：启用重计算调度器。当解码节点KV缓存不足时，请求会被发送回预填充节点以重计算KV缓存。\n"
"- `--async-scheduling`：解码端启用异步调度。"

msgid "**Mooncake KV transfer configuration (`--kv-transfer-config`):**"
msgstr "**Mooncake KV传输配置（`--kv-transfer-config`）：**"

msgid ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer communication. Use different port ranges for prefill (`30000`) and decode (`30200`) node groups.\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache, reducing latency.\n"
"- `\"engine_id\"`: Fixed engine id of the Mooncake connector per role group: `0` for the prefill engine (shared by the two PP ranks) and `2` for the decode engines.\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: Specify the parallelism of the prefill and decode node groups respectively. These must match the actual deployment topology (`prefill: dp_size 1, pp_size 2, tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition \"41,37\"`, `decode: dp_size 16, tp_size 2`)."
msgstr ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用Mooncake作为预填充和解码节点之间的KV缓存传输连接器。\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：预填充节点上为`kv_producer`，解码节点上为`kv_consumer`。\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV传输通信端口。为预填充（`30000`）和解码（`30200`）节点组使用不同的端口范围。\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：启用KV缓存的Ascend直接传输，降低延迟。\n"
"- `\"engine_id\"`：每个角色组的Mooncake连接器的固定引擎ID：预填充引擎为`0`（由两个PP rank共享），解码引擎为`2`。\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"`部分：分别指定预填充和解码节点组的并行度。这些必须与实际部署拓扑匹配（`prefill: dp_size 1, pp_size 2, tp_size 16, pp_layer_partition \"41,37\"`，`decode: dp_size 16, tp_size 2`）。"

