msgstr "### 5.2 1M上下文配置"

msgid "#### 5.2.1 Single-Node 1M Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 单节点1M部署"

msgid ""
"- Quantized model `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` can be deployed on 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB ×"
" 16) for the 1M context."
msgstr "- 量化模型 `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` 可在1台Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）上部署以支持1M上下文。"

msgid "#### 5.2.2 Dual-Node Co-Located 1M Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2 双节点共置1M部署"

msgid ""
"- `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` can be deployed on 2 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) for the 1M "
"context."
msgstr "- `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8` 可在2台Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）上部署以支持1M上下文。"

msgid "#### 5.2.3 PD Disaggregation 1M Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.3 PD分离1M部署"

msgid ""
"PD disaggregation for the 1M context with the `GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` weights can "
"be deployed on 4 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16)."
msgstr "使用 `GLM-5.2-w8a8c8` 权重的1M上下文PD分离可在4台Atlas 800 A3（64GB × 16）上部署。"

msgid ""
"prepare the script `launch_online_dp.py` on each node (used by the prefill "
"and decode nodes below to pass the engine port and DP parameters):"
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上准备脚本 `launch_online_dp.py`（供下面的prefill和decode节点使用，以传递引擎端口和DP参数）："

msgid "prepare the script `run_dp_template.sh` on each node."
msgstr "在每个节点上准备脚本 `run_dp_template.sh`。"

msgid ""
"DP rank `1`, engine port `9082`. Same script as p0 with `server_role_args=\""
"--headless\"` (non-master node, no API server); `--data-parallel-address` "
"(`$5`) still points to prefill node 0 (DP master node)."
msgstr ""
"DP rank `1`，引擎端口 `9082`。与p0相同的脚本，但使用 `server_role_args=\"--"
"headless\"`（非主节点，无API服务器）；`--data-parallel-"
"address`（`$5`）仍指向prefill节点0（DP主节点）。"

msgid "Once the preparation is done, start the server on each node:"
msgstr "准备完成后，在每个节点上启动服务器："

msgid "To set up request forwarding, run the following script on any machine."
msgstr "要设置请求转发，请在任意机器上运行以下脚本。"

msgid ""
"Key Parameter Descriptions (in addition to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation](#513-prefill-decode-disaggregation) and [Single-Node 1M "
"Deployment](#521-single-node-1m-deployment)):"
msgstr ""
"关键参数说明（除 [Prefill-Decode分离](#513-prefill-decode-disaggregation) 和 "
"[单节点1M部署](#521-single-node-1m-deployment) 之外）："

msgid ""
"The `run_dp_template.sh` templates use the positional parameters passed by "
"`launch_online_dp.py`: `$1` = visible devices, `$2` = engine port, `$3` = "
"data-parallel-size, `$4` = data-parallel-rank, `$5` = data-parallel-address,"
" `$6` = data-parallel-rpc-port, `$7` = tensor-parallel-size."
msgstr ""
"`run_dp_template.sh` 模板使用 `launch_online_dp.py` 传递的位置参数：`$1` = 可见设备，`$2` = "
"引擎端口，`$3` = data-parallel-size，`$4` = data-parallel-rank，`$5` = data-"
"parallel-address，`$6` = data-parallel-rpc-port，`$7` = tensor-parallel-size。"

msgid ""
"**1M-specific environment variables (both prefiller and decoder nodes):**"
msgstr "**1M特定环境变量（prefiller和decoder节点均需设置）：**"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=100000` / `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=3600000` / "
"`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=204` / "
"`HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=7200` / `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=10000` / "
"`ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT=10000` / `MF_GROUP_JOIN_MAX_TIMEOUT=1200`: Timeout "
"settings for the slow multi-node startup and model execution of the 1M "
"context scenario. Increase them if the engine fails to become ready in time."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=100000` / `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=3600000` / "
"`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=204` / "
"`HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=7200` / `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=10000` / "
"`ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT=10000` / "
"`MF_GROUP_JOIN_MAX_TIMEOUT=1200`：针对1M上下文场景中多节点启动和模型执行较慢的超时设置。如果引擎未能及时就绪，请增大这些值。"

msgid "**Prefill nodes (1M):**"
msgstr "**Prefill节点（1M）：**"

msgid ""
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`: Minimal MTP speculation during prefill.\n"
"- `mega_moe_max_tokens=8192` (in `--additional-config`): Per-rank token capacity after dispatch in the fused MC2/MegaMoe path.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_producer` with `prefill: dp2 tp16` / `decode: dp4 tp8`."
msgstr ""
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1, ...}'`：prefill期间的最小MTP投机。\n"
"- `mega_moe_max_tokens=8192`（在 `--additional-config` 中）：融合MC2/MegaMoe路径中dispatch后的每rank token容量。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake连接器作为 `kv_producer`，配置为 `prefill: dp2 tp16` / `decode: dp4 tp8`。"

msgid "**Decode nodes (1M):**"
msgstr "**Decode节点（1M）：**"

msgid ""
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`: Small batch token limit on decode nodes — decode nodes store the large 1M KV cache received from prefill nodes.\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`: MLAPO fusion on decode nodes for memory-bandwidth-bound token generation.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config`: Mooncake connector as `kv_consumer` (`kv_port: 30200`)."
msgstr ""
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`：decode节点上的小批量token限制——decode节点存储从prefill节点接收的大型1M KV缓存。\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`：在decode节点上启用MLAPO融合，用于内存带宽受限的token生成。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config`：Mooncake连接器作为 `kv_consumer`（`kv_port: 30200`）。"

