msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid "### 9.1 Tested Performance Cases"
msgstr "### 9.1 已测试的性能用例"

msgid "#### Table 1: Prefill-Only Test Cases"
msgstr "#### 表1：仅Prefill测试用例"

msgid ""
"|Scenario|Configuration|NPUs|TP|DP|PP|Max Model Len|MTP Speculation Num|"
msgstr ""
"|Scenario|Configuration|NPUs|TP|DP|PP|Max Model Len|MTP Speculation Num|"

msgid "### 9.2 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.2 推荐配置"

msgid "#### Table 2: Optimizations Requiring Explicit Enablement"
msgstr "#### 表2：需要显式启用的优化"

msgid "|Optimization|Scenario|Enablement|Principle (Benefits)|Notes|"
msgstr "|Optimization|Scenario|Enablement|Principle (Benefits)|Notes|"

msgid ""
"|FlashComm_v1|A3 prefill nodes / co-located nodes|`export "
"VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`|Splits AllReduce into Reduce-Scatter and "
"All-Gather, improving prefill throughput and reducing communication "
"latency|Not available when `layer_sharding` includes `o_proj`|"
msgstr ""
"|FlashComm_v1|A3 prefill节点 / 共置节点|`export "
"VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`|将AllReduce拆分为Reduce-Scatter和All-"
"Gather，提升prefill吞吐量并降低通信延迟|当 `layer_sharding` 包含 `o_proj` 时不可用|"

msgid ""
"|Fused MC2|A3 prefill nodes|`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`|Replaces"
" ALLTOALL+MC2 with the `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`dispatch_gmm_combine_decode` "
"operators, reducing MoE communication overhead and improving MoE inference "
"performance|`dispatch_ffn_combine` only for w8a8, EP≤32, non-MTP, non-"
"dynamic-EPLB; conflicts with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` (the latter"
" is auto-disabled)|"
msgstr ""
"|Fused MC2|A3 prefill节点|`export VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`|用 "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`dispatch_gmm_combine_decode` "
"算子替代ALLTOALL+MC2，降低MoE通信开销并提升MoE推理性能|`dispatch_ffn_combine` "
"仅适用于w8a8、EP≤32、非MTP、非动态EPLB；与 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` "
"冲突（后者会自动禁用）|"

msgid ""
"|MLAPO|A3 co-located / PD decode nodes; A2 P/D nodes|`export "
"VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`|Fuses the MLA preprocess operations, "
"significantly improving decode performance|Consumes more NPU memory; in PD "
"scenarios enable on decode nodes only|"
msgstr ""
"|MLAPO|A3共置 / PD decode节点；A2 P/D节点|`export "
"VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_MLAPO=1`|融合MLA预处理操作，显著提升decode性能|消耗更多NPU内存；在PD场景中仅需在decode节点上启用|"

msgid ""
"|DSA CP|A3 prefill nodes; long context|`--additional-config "
"'{\"enable_dsa_cp\": true}'`|DSA context parallelism accelerates long-"
"context prefill, reducing TTFT for long prompts|In the reference configs, "
"enabled on co-located nodes and PD prefill nodes; PD decode nodes use decode"
" context parallelism instead|"
msgstr ""
"|DSA CP|A3 prefill节点；长上下文|`--additional-config '{\"enable_dsa_cp\": "
"true}'`|DSA上下文并行加速长上下文prefill，降低长提示的TTFT|在参考配置中，在共置节点和PD prefill节点上启用；PD "
"decode节点改用decode上下文并行|"

msgid ""
"|Sparse SFA C8|A3 (w8a8c8); long-context prefill|`--additional-config "
"'{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true}'`|Sparse Flash Attention skips unnecessary"
" attention computation of the C8 quantized model, accelerating long-context "
"prefill|Experimental in v0.23.0. On the w8a8c8 weights it can be combined "
"with DCP/context parallelism (as in the reference configs in this document);"
" on the w4a8c8 weights enabling both together has known issues and is not "
"recommended|"
msgstr ""
"|Sparse SFA C8|A3 (w8a8c8)；长上下文prefill|`--additional-config "
"'{\"enable_sparse_sfa_c8\": true}'`|Sparse Flash "
"Attention跳过C8量化模型不必要的注意力计算，加速长上下文prefill|在v0.23.0中为实验性功能。在w8a8c8权重上可与DCP/上下文并行结合使用（如本文档中的参考配置）；在w4a8c8权重上同时启用两者存在已知问题，不建议使用|"

msgid ""
"|Sparse LI C8|A3 (w8a8c8)|`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": "
"true}'`|Sparse attention optimization reduces computation of the C8 "
"quantized model, improving throughput|Independent of `enable_sparse_sfa_c8`|"
msgstr ""
"|Sparse LI C8|A3 (w8a8c8)|`--additional-config '{\"enable_sparse_li_c8\": "
"true}'`|稀疏注意力优化减少C8量化模型的计算量，提升吞吐量|与`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`相互独立|"

msgid ""
"|Recompute Scheduler|A3 decode nodes|`--additional-config "
"'{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`|Recomputes KV cache on prefill "
"nodes when decode KV cache is insufficient, avoiding decode-side OOM and "
"improving throughput|Set to `false` on prefill nodes|"
msgstr ""
"|Recompute Scheduler|A3 decode节点|`--additional-config "
"'{\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}'`|当decode KV "
"cache不足时，在prefill节点上重新计算KV cache，避免decode侧OOM并提升吞吐量|在prefill节点上设置为`false`|"

msgid ""
"|Multistream Overlap Shared Expert|A3|`--additional-config "
"'{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": true}'`|Overlaps shared-expert "
"computation on an additional stream, hiding its latency and improving decode"
" performance|Auto-disabled when `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`|"
msgstr ""
"|Multistream Overlap Shared Expert|A3|`--additional-config "
"'{\"multistream_overlap_shared_expert\": "
"true}'`|在额外流上重叠共享专家计算，隐藏其延迟并提升decode性能|当`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`时自动禁用|"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

