"- `GLM-5.2-w4a8c8`: requires 1 Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8) node or 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) node.[Download model weight](https://modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.2-w4a8c8).\n"
